    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i see. but what about national sovereignty? a lot of people feel like these treaties force countries to give up control over their own laws and resources just to satisfy these global rules. isn't there a valid point to be made that countries should prioritize their own citizens' interests over these international mandates?",
